# ros-docker-scripts

This repository provides scripts to run Robot Operating System (ROS 2) in Docker containers.

## Directories

1. **[docker/](docker/)** — Standard ROS 2 Docker containers for building, running, and testing code. GUI rendering is not supported.

2. **[nvidia_docker/](nvidia_docker/)** — GPU-accelerated Docker containers that support NVIDIA CUDA for hardware-accelerated simulation in Gazebo and RViz2.

## Version Information

This version supports **ROS 2 Lyrical** on **Ubuntu 26.04 LTS**. Older versions are available on other branches. Each directory includes a `README.md` file with detailed usage instructions.

